<title>UK: BayerVB to launch 2.0 bln mark bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB to launch 2.0 bln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank AG said on Monday it will launch a 2.0 billion mark global, public-sector Pfandbrief on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal will mature on June 24, 2002 and will be priced to yield 18 basis points over the 4.5 percent series 122 Obl. It will be rated AAA by Moody's and Standard and Poor's.</p>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank and Merrill Lynch will be joint lead managers on the deal. --London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
